From 0f2c8090dfe4559be6f96760f9c6bfb50c031861 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:02:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Recover refused partial-clone blobs for upstream
 classification

Git remerge-diff can fail forever when upload-pack rejects promised blob OIDs even though GitHub REST serves them. Retry only recognized missing-object failures, recover at most 32 distinct blobs through existing broker-aware gh, decode base64 losslessly and verify each Git object ID before storing it. Unavailable, invalid or repeated failures remain REFUSED.

Proof: real file:// blob:none conflict fixture fails on base and on reverted recovery (both classifier and standalone CLI tests), passes with recovery. Unobtainable REST blobs still REFUSE; malformed/base64, wrong bytes, timeout, Git hash/store failures and bounded retries covered. Seven safety mutants killed. Focused classifier/gate and subprocess guard suites pass; scripts/check all 20 checks pass.
---
